      "content": "Conversion of mlabonne/Qwen3-30B-A3B-abliterated (EXL3 4bpw H8) faults with the following error:\n`torch._C._LinAlgError: linalg.cholesky: The factorization could not be completed because the input is not positive-definite (the leading minor of order 1 is not positive-definite).`\n\nAs pure Qwen/Qwen3-30B-A3B conversion works fine, seems like abliteration messed up something.\n\n<details>\n  <summary>Trace</summary>\n  \n  ```python\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/opt/exl/exllamav3/convert.py\", line 11, in <module>\n    main(_in_args, _job_state)\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.11/dist-packages/torch/utils/_contextlib.py\", line 116, in decorate_context\n    return func(*args, **kwargs)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/opt/exl/exllamav3/exllamav3/conversion/convert_model.py\", line 354, in main\n    proxy_err = linear.convert_exl3(\n                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/opt/exl/exllamav3/exllamav3/modules/linear.py\", line 226, in convert_exl3\n    weight_q, proxy_err, out_tensors = quantize_exl3(\n                                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/opt/exl/exllamav3/exllamav3/modules/quant/exl3_lib/quantize.py\", line 765, in quantize_exl3\n    H, L, su, H_diag = finalize_capture_H(H_data, quant_args, verbose)\n                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/opt/exl/exllamav3/exllamav3/modules/quant/exl3_lib/quantize.py\", line 472, in finalize_capture_H\n    L, H = block_ldl(H, 16, verbose)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/opt/exl/exllamav3/exllamav3/modules/quant/exl3_lib/quantize.py\", line 279, in block_ldl\n    raise e\n  File \"/opt/exl/exllamav3/exllamav3/modules/quant/exl3_lib/quantize.py\", line 266, in block_ldl\n    L = torch.linalg.cholesky(H)\n        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\ntorch._C._LinAlgError: linalg.cholesky: The factorization could not be completed because the input is not positive-definite (the leading minor of order 1 is not positive-definite).\n  ```\n  \n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>Conversion log (restart)</summary>\n\n``` txt\n                 - [2x] RMSNorm\n             - RMSNorm\n             - BlockSparseMLP\n                 - [385x] Linear\n         - RMSNorm\n         - Linear\n -- Loaded tokenizer\n    Vocab size: 151669\n -- Resuming at: model.layers.19\n -- Loading unquantized module: model.layers.19\n\n-- Captured: model.layers.19\n !! Warning: block.mlp.input state has 0 inf values and 89,430,038,272 NaN values (out of 107,374,182,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.0.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.1.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.2.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.3.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.4.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.5.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.6.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.7.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.8.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.9.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.10.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.11.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.12.down state has 0 inf values and 157,286,400 NaN values (out of 157,286,400)\n !! Warning: block.mlp.13.down state has 0 inf values a", "encoding": "utf-8", "source": {"author_login": "artus-dev", "catalog_origin": "closed_discussion", "content_bytes": 19901, "content_sha256": "2a2e4011dba0de60a5a1f946f50c074ced6fb4007ff41b3dcaa1bce0d6f46f6c", "created_at": "2025-05-27T11:27:11Z", "kind": "web", "representation": "discussion_snapshot_json", "retrieved_at": "2026-11-18T18:31:43.094823+00:00", "revision_at": "2025-05-27T13:51:40Z", "source_id": "unreferenced-issue-43@2025-07-29T22:25:28+02:00", "url": "https://github.com/turboderp-org/exllamav3/issues/43"}}}

